{"ref":"BDB, מָסָךְ²","hw":"מָסָךְ²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מָסָךְ</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>covering, screen</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.19\">2 S 17:19</a> + 11 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָסַךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.8\">Is 22:8</a> + 12 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>covering</em>, large cloth spread <span dir=\"rtl\">(פרש)</span> over well to hide persons within <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.19\">2 S 17:19</a>; fig. of protection, or of eye-screen, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְגַל אֶת־מ׳ יְהוּדָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.8\">Is 22:8</a>; <em>screen</em>, of cloud <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:39\" href=\"/Psalms.105.39\">ψ 105:39</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(פרשׂ)</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  name given (in P) to each of three <em>screens</em>, of tabern.: <strong>a.</strong>  at gate <span dir=\"rtl\">(שַׁעַר)</span> of court <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:16\" href=\"/Exodus.27.16\">Ex 27:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:17\" href=\"/Exodus.35.17\">35:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:18\" href=\"/Exodus.38.18\">38:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:40\" href=\"/Exodus.39.40\">39:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:8\" href=\"/Exodus.40.8\">40:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:33\" href=\"/Exodus.40.33\">33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:26\" href=\"/Numbers.3.26\">Nu 3:26</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(פֶּתַח)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.26\">4:26</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  at entrance <span dir=\"rtl\">(פֶּתַח)</span> of tent <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:36\" href=\"/Exodus.26.36\">Ex 26:36</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:37\" href=\"/Exodus.26.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:15\" href=\"/Exodus.35.15\">35:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:37\" href=\"/Exodus.36.37\">36:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:38\" href=\"/Exodus.39.38\">39:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:5\" href=\"/Exodus.40.5\">40:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:28\" href=\"/Exodus.40.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:25\" href=\"/Numbers.3.25\">Nu 3:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:31\" href=\"/Numbers.3.31\">31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:25\" href=\"/Numbers.4.25\">4:25</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרֹכֶת הַמּ׳</span> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, פָּסַח\" href=\"/BDB,_פָּסַח\", dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</a>), dividing off the Most Holy Place within the tent, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:12\" href=\"/Exodus.35.12\">Ex 35:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:34\" href=\"/Exodus.39.34\">39:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:21\" href=\"/Exodus.40.21\">40:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:5\" href=\"/Numbers.4.5\">Nu 4:5</a>.","next":"BDB, מְסֻכָֿה","prev":"BDB, סָכַךְ"}